{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "x-touch-compact-mc-playback-1",
  "name": "X-Touch Compact (MC) Playback 1",
  "status": "tested",
  "notes": "Playback layout for the X-Touch Compact in MC mode. Faders -> executors 201-208 (+ main 209) with motor feedback; top encoders (relative) -> executor faders 401-408 with LED-ring feedback, push = go on the same executor; button rows -> 401-408 / 301-308 / 201-208 with LED state, fader buttons -> 101-108 (+ main 109). The 8 side encoders drive executors 291-298: pushes of encoders 9-14 press executors 291-296; encoders 15/16 have no push in MC mode, so their rotation (note-pair encoders, one detent = +/-1) turns executor knobs 297/298. Layer A = Page Down, Layer B = Page Up (QuickKeys); side transport block: Highlight | Clear / Prev | Next / Up | Down (QuickKeys, changed 2026-08-01). Input side hardware-verified 2026-07-27 by live capture.",
  "deviceDefinitionId": "x-touch-compact-mc",
